<title>KasirKu — Status &amp; Rencana Kerja</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #f2f4ee;
    --surface: #fdfdfb;
    --ink: #1a211c;
    --ink-soft: #545e54;
    --line: #d9dcd2;
    --accent: #0e6b57;
    --accent-soft: #dceae4;
    --done: #2f8f5b;
    --done-soft: #e2f0e7;
    --decision: #a8681f;
    --decision-soft: #f5e6d0;
    --gap: #ab4438;
    --gap-soft: #f6e1dd;
    --waiting: #5b6470;
    --waiting-soft: #e6e8e4;

    --font-display: ui-serif, "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --font-body: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Code", "Roboto Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --paper: #121613;
      --surface: #181e1a;
      --ink: #e9eae2;
      --ink-soft: #a3ab9f;
      --line: #2b322c;
      --accent: #4fbfa3;
      --accent-soft: #16332c;
      --done: #56c48a;
      --done-soft: #17301f;
      --decision: #e0a857;
      --decision-soft: #362610;
      --gap: #e2776a;
      --gap-soft: #341c17;
      --waiting: #9aa4ac;
      --waiting-soft: #1e2422;
    }
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    --paper: #121613;
    --surface: #181e1a;
    --ink: #e9eae2;
    --ink-soft: #a3ab9f;
    --line: #2b322c;
    --accent: #4fbfa3;
    --accent-soft: #16332c;
    --done: #56c48a;
    --done-soft: #17301f;
    --decision: #e0a857;
    --decision-soft: #362610;
    --gap: #e2776a;
    --gap-soft: #341c17;
    --waiting: #9aa4ac;
    --waiting-soft: #1e2422;
  }
  :root[data-theme="light"] {
    --paper: #f2f4ee;
    --surface: #fdfdfb;
    --ink: #1a211c;
    --ink-soft: #545e54;
    --line: #d9dcd2;
    --accent: #0e6b57;
    --accent-soft: #dceae4;
    --done: #2f8f5b;
    --done-soft: #e2f0e7;
    --decision: #a8681f;
    --decision-soft: #f5e6d0;
    --gap: #ab4438;
    --gap-soft: #f6e1dd;
    --waiting: #5b6470;
    --waiting-soft: #e6e8e4;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .page {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 80px;
  }

  /* ---- Header ---- */
  .report-head {
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .report-head .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px);
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .report-head .date {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: right;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* ---- Stat strip ---- */
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .stat {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 18px 18px 16px;
  }
  .stat .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .stat .value {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .stat .value.ok { color: var(--done); }
  .stat .value.wait { color: var(--decision); }

  /* ---- Section ---- */
  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .section-head .count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* ---- Ledger rows ---- */
  .ledger-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 14px 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .ledger-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .ledger-row .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .ledger-row .note {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 3px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .chip {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .chip.done { background: var(--done-soft); color: var(--done); }
  .chip.decision { background: var(--decision-soft); color: var(--decision); }
  .chip.gap { background: var(--gap-soft); color: var(--gap); }
  .chip.waiting { background: var(--waiting-soft); color: var(--waiting); }

  /* ---- Condensed strip (core engine) ---- */
  .strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 10px;
    padding: 4px 2px 2px;
  }
  .strip-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .strip-item::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--done);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Callout ---- */
  .callout {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--waiting);
    padding: 16px 18px;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
  }
  .callout .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .callout .note {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .callout .filelist {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ---- Priority list ---- */
  .priority {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    counter-reset: pri;
  }
  .priority li {
    counter-increment: pri;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 13px 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .priority li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .priority li::before {
    content: counter(pri, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .priority .name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; }
  .priority .note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 3px; max-width: 62ch; }

  footer {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .ledger-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .chip { justify-self: start; }
    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .page { animation: rise 0.4s ease-out; }
    @keyframes rise {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="page">

  <div class="report-head">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">KasirKu — Rekap Kerja</div>
      <h1>Status &amp; Rencana Kerja Besok</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="date">12 Juli 2026<br />disiapkan malam hari</div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="label">Fitur growth hari ini</div>
      <div class="value ok">6 / 6 selesai</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="label">Engine KasirKu (POS+ERP)</div>
      <div class="value ok">Solid</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="label">Siap terima bayar publik</div>
      <div class="value wait">3 keputusan tertunda</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Dikerjakan &amp; Terverifikasi Hari Ini</h2>
      <span class="count">6 item</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">Google Analytics (GA4)</div>
        <div class="note">Terpasang env-var gated, event custom (afiliasi &amp; kalkulator) terkonfirmasi masuk dataLayer &amp; Realtime.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">Google Search Console</div>
        <div class="note">Property terverifikasi (HTML tag), sitemap disubmit — cek besok statusnya sudah "Success" atau masih "Couldn't fetch".</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">Bing Webmaster Tools</div>
        <div class="note">Di-import langsung dari Google Search Console, sitemap ikut terbawa otomatis.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">/rekomendasi-alat</div>
        <div class="note">Halaman afiliasi publik — 4 kategori alat, tapi link masih ke pencarian marketplace biasa, belum link afiliasi bertengkomisi.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">/blog — 2 artikel SEO</div>
        <div class="note">"Cara Hitung HPP" &amp; "Cara Baca Laba Rugi" — lengkap sitemap.xml &amp; robots.txt.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">/kalkulator-hpp</div>
        <div class="note">Kalkulator interaktif + banner mencolok di landing page, tracking klik CTA terverifikasi jalan end-to-end.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip done">Selesai</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Engine Inti KasirKu</h2>
      <span class="count">sebelum hari ini</span>
    </div>
    <div class="strip">
      <span class="strip-item">Kasir F&amp;B / Retail / Tiket</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Stok, Resep, HPP otomatis</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Akuntansi penuh (Jurnal–Neraca–Rekonsiliasi)</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Payroll &amp; Absensi</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Supplier &amp; Piutang</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Multi-tenant + RLS</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Billing Midtrans (kode siap, E2E teruji)</span>
      <span class="strip-item">Panel Superadmin</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Belum Selesai — Butuh Keputusan / Kerjaan Bisnis</h2>
      <span class="count">7 item</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
      <div>
        <div class="name">Harga final belum ditentukan</div>
        <div class="note">Kode masih placeholder (Rp99rb / Rp990rb / Rp2,5jt). Usulan angka baru (Rp129rb / Rp1,29jt / Rp3,9jt) sempat dibahas tapi belum pernah dikonfirmasi atau diterapkan ke kode.</div>
      </div>
      <span class="chip decision">Perlu keputusan</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ledger-row">
